  "summary": "在 1 到 n 中寻找整数 x，使 1 到 x 的和等于 x 到 n 的和；不存在返回负一。",
  "insight": "由 x(x+1)/2 = n(n+1)/2 - x(x-1)/2 可化简为 x²=n(n+1)/2，因此只需判断总和是否为完全平方数。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "x 在等式两边都被计入",
    "平方根取整后还要回代验证",
    "n=1 时答案是一"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "perfect-square-total-sum",
      "title": "总和完全平方判断",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用代数式消去两个前缀和。",
      "steps": [
        "计算 total=n*(n+1)/2",
        "root=floor(sqrt(total))",
        "若 root*root==total 返回 root，否则返回 -1"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(1)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/perfect-square-total-sum/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/perfect-square-total-sum/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/perfect-square-total-sum/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
